SUMMARY:ECCE Asia 2027: Digest submission (23:59 Asia/Seoul)
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Energy Conversion Congress and Exposition Asia (ECCE Asia 
 2027)\n\nDigest submission: 25 Oct 2026\, 23:59 Asia/Seoul\n\nConference: 
 May 23-26\, 2027\nLocation: Seoul\, South Korea\nVenue: COEX Magok\n\nAll 
 dates:\n  Digest submission: 25 Oct 2026\, 23:59 Asia/Seoul\n  Acceptance 
 notification: 15 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final manuscript sub
 mission: 12 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Early registration: 31 Ma
 r 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers states no timezone.
  This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\, so the
  countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than after it.\n\nHeld
  as ICPE 2027-ECCE Asia\, the 12th International Conference on Power Elect
 ronics.\n\nCall for papers: https://www.icpe-conf.org/\nDetails: https://l
 angestefan.github.io/powersystem-deadlines/conference/ecce-asia27
LOCATION:Seoul\, South Korea
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.icpe-conf.org/
